1. Technical review of long-term and short-term memory for the on-device agent. We refactored the entire memory system, redesigning it based on Hermes' long/short-term memory approach, building on the original simple memory.
2. Added Graphiti for the on-device agent's external memory. Basic functionality is in place, but integration is not fully complete, and performance needs optimization.
3. In line with the memory refactor, the KV cache in mlx-vlm needs to be refactored to address performance issues. Initial attempts are underway.
